WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.650
It was only a small wish...

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.480
To have quiet, uneventful days...

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.490
To have every day come one
after the other in peace...

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.990
But during those days which
we loved more than anything,

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.120
a dark shadow silently fell upon us.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.870
The power to break free
from the chains of destiny...

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.250
If we can claim that power
with our own hands...

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.670
we won't care if we have to
throw everything else away.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.920
The vow I made beneath
the stars in the night sky.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.180
"With this sword, I will rend the future."

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:40.010
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:35.880
Um... when you say they're false beings
that are neither human nor familiar...

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:36.760
wouldn't that mean they're like me—

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.260
No!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:43.430
Fate-san, you <i>are</i> a real
human being, with a real life...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.520
who was only born in a slightly
different way from everyone else.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.020
This was confirmed when
you were examined before.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.020
Don't say things like that.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.940
Yes... I'm sorry.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.780
Ah, I know! Why don't we
use the monitor to explain?

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:10.210
The guardians are the Book of Darkness's
internal programs given human form.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.460
The Book of Darkness
may die and be reborn,

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.960
but these four have always been with it,

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.340
working for many different
masters in the past.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.180
It has been confirmed
that in past incidents,

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.100
they've been able to communicate with each
other to better understand their mission, but...

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.560
there hasn't been any record of
them ever showing emotions.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:34.360
Their only goals are to gather pages for
the Book, and to protect their master.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:39.610
But that girl with the hat, Vita-chan,
she got angry and unhappy at times...

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.240
I also clearly got a sense
of Signum's personality.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:50.120
She said she had something she had to do...
for her comrades and her master.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.120
For her master, huh?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:02.720
Well, why don't we wait to hear from
the clerks investigating the matter?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.300
Looking at their teleportation patterns,

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:07.470
we can confirm that their master
is somewhere in this vicinity.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.480
It might actually be possible to capture
their master before capturing them.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.980
Ah, that makes things much simpler.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.980
Yeah. If we find whoever it is
before the Book is complete,

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.270
they'll probably turn out to
be some normal mage.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:18.730
Yeah.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:24.200
At any rate, I definitely want more
detailed data on the Book of Darkness.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.700
Yuuno, I need you to do
me a favor tomorrow.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.410
Sure...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:41.960
<i>Hey, Yuuno-kun, I wonder what kind of
person the Book of Darkness's master is...</i>

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.510
<i>It looks like the Book of Darkness
picks someone by chance,</i>

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.470
<i>so probably someone with potential
to control it as its new host.</i>

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.720
<i>I see.</i>

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.640
<i>Wouldn't it be funny if it
was someone my own age?</i>

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.100
<i>Uh... that might be a bit too random...</i>

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.870
<i>Suzuka-chan said she's having
a friend stay over tonight.</i>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:09.910
<i>Really?</i>

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.990
<i>Yeah. Look.</i>

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.040
<i>That's Yagami Hayate-chan.</i>

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>She said she'll introduce us
next time we all meet up.</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.260
It Was a Small Wish.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:30.640
Really, thanks a lot, Suzuka-chan.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.390
Yeah, see you again.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.640
Please come again whenever
you like, Hayate-chan!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.150
Thank you very much.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:45.990
Signum...

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.070
It looks like Hayate-chan will be back soon.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.490
I see.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.870
Where's Vita-chan?
Still out?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.250
Yeah, she's pretty far away right now.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.250
She said she'd be back in the evening.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.210
What about you, Signum?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.050
What about me?

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.420
Are you all right?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.340
It looks like you've been exerting
a great deal of your mana lately.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:15.060
We're not as weak as you're always
making us out to be. I'm fine.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.940
You've really changed.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.190
You never used to smile like this.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.690
Is that so?

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:29.610
And it's not just you.
We've all really changed since then.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:34.990
Ever since Hayate-chan
became our master.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:43.790
Is that so? It must be a lot of fun,
living together with your relatives.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.630
Yes. We have oodles of fun every day!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.300
That must be wonderful.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:58.230
<i>Right... it's already been a little over
six months since everyone came...</i>

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.500
Activating.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.830
We have affirmed the activation
of the Book of Darkness.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:06.880
We shall gather power for the
Book of Darkness and guard you, Master,

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.460
for we are your guardian knights.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.510
We are the clouds that gather before
our master, she of the night sky.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.970
We are the Wolkenritter.
Please order us as you wish.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.650
<i>Hey... guys...</i>

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.190
<i>Vita-chan, shh!</i>

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.190
<i>But...</i>

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.030
<i>Quiet.</i>

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.240
<i>I won't pardon rudeness before our master.</i>

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:37.830
<i>Rude or not,
it looks like she fainted.</i>

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:38.780
<i>No way!</i>

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.750
Hayate-chan! Thank goodness
it was nothing serious.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.340
Umm... I'm really sorry.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.380
So... who are these people?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.190
That was quite a shock
back then, wasn't it?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.730
You could say that.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:11.190
Who are they?
Even though spring just began,

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.990
it's still cold out, but they brought you
here without even putting on jackets...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.070
They're all dressed
pretty weirdly, too...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.120
And I can't understand
what they're talking about.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.910
They look pretty suspicious to me...

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:23.750
Ah... umm... uhh... how do I put it...

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.750
<i>If you order us,
we shall come to your aid.</i>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.420
<i>What say you?</i>

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.010
<i>I'm speaking to you telepathically.</i>

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.760
<i>If you just feel the orders you
want to give us in your heart...</i>

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.640
<i>I won't call it an order, but a request.</i>

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.480
<i>Make your story match mine, okay?</i>

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.230
Yes.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:53.940
Umm... Dr. Ishida, these four
are actually my relatives.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:54.940
Your relatives?!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.240
They came from their home country
far away to celebrate my birthday.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.330
And they came dressed in
costume to surprise me, so...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.410
I was a little too shocked
by it all, and umm...

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.290
That's pretty much it.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.170
Right?

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:12.920
That's right!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:13.920
Exactly as she said.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.510
Our new master...

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.010
Master Hayate...

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:27.430
was very different from our
previous masters, and not just in age.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:34.610
I see... so this one is called
the Book of Darkness...

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:35.360
Yes.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.860
It's been on my bookshelf for
as long as I can remember.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.370
But I've taken care of it,
since it's a really pretty book.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:49.620
Did you ever hear its voice at all,
whether you were awake or asleep?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:54.920
Well, since I'm not a mage,
I'm not really sure.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.090
Ah, here it is.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.430
But there's one thing I'm sure of.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.260
As the master of the Book of Darkness...

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.300
I need to provide you guardian knights
with some necessities,

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:06.140
and I need to take care of you.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:09.640
Luckily, I have a place of my own
to live in, and I'm good at cooking.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:13.440
I'll buy you clothes,
so let me measure you, okay?

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:21.070
Yes... she was completely different from
the previous masters we had served.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.030
Master Hayate's interactions with us...

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:30.330
weren't oppressive, and she didn't treat
us like tools as our previous masters had.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.380
She treated us as if we were family.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.100
All done!

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.150
Shall we eat?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.190
Let's eat!

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.650
Let's eat.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.870
We had our hesitations, but...

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:12.290
as our new mistress wished,
we began living a quiet life with her.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.580
Seconds, please...

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.960
Coming right up!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.180
Knight armor?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:37.900
Yes. We have our own weapons,
but our master must grant us our armor.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.230
We'll make them
with our own magic,

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.320
so if you can just imagine what
it'd look like, that'd be fine.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.820
I see...

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.950
You keep saying stuff like that,
but I won't have you fight for me, so...

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.660
Would clothes be all right?
Knight-like clothes.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.580
Yes. That would be okay.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:59.590
Then I'll do some research and think up
some really cool outfits for you guys.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:01.590
This is...

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.050
Don't worry about it.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:06.590
You can only find the right material for
something like this in places like these.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.100
I see...

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.600
Vita-chan, what's wrong?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.100
Vita-chan?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:17.900
The breeze sure feels nice.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.230
Yeah.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:20.940
It's so nice out.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.900
A great day for a stroll, huh?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.900
Vita.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.120
You can take it out of the bag now.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.910
Hayate, thank y–

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:49.390
Time passed slowly, and we simply
led uneventful days together with our master.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.640
It's so beautiful!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:59.520
Master Hayate, is this really all right?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.400
What do you mean?

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.730
The Book of Darkness.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:12.160
By your command, we could soon fill its
pages, and you would gain incredible power.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.750
Even these legs of yours
would be healed, too.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.120
You can't.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:22.250
It would cause a lot of people trouble
if you filled its pages, right?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.920
So you can't.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.760
It wouldn't be good to burden other
people with my own selfishness.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:35.600
I'm happy enough as I am right now.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.270
Mom and Dad are with the stars now.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:44.190
But my father's friend is
currently overseeing the house.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.570
Your father's friend?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:51.070
Yeah. Thanks to him, I've been
able to live here without a hitch.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:55.580
And above all else,
everyone's here with me now, too.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.460
Hayate!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.970
Ah, what's the matter, Vita?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:11.470
Hayate, is it okay if I eat the
ice cream in the freezer?

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.970
After eating so much at dinner,
you still have room for more?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.810
Shut up! I'm a growing girl, you know!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.480
And Hayate's cooking
is giga-yummy, too!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.730
I guess there's no helping it.
But just a little, though.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:24.730
Thanks!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:28.940
Signum.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:29.570
Yes?

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:34.530
Signum, you're their leader,
so... promise me something.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.490
Yes?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:41.250
Your "current master, Yagami Hayate"
wishes for nothing from the Book of Darkness.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.920
While I'm your master,
could you forget all about it?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.470
Everyone's job is to live together
while getting along with everyone.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.720
That's all.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.680
Can you promise me that?

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.720
I promise,

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.810
on my knight's sword.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.940
Her life is at risk?

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.440
Hayate-chan's is...?

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:11.950
Yes...

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:17.740
As I told you, the nerve paralysis in her
legs is caused by an unknown source.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.960
In these past six months, the paralysis
has slowly spread up her body.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:25.210
It's become very clear in
these past two months.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:32.050
At this rate, there's a risk of the
paralysis reaching her internal organs.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.680
Why?!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:36.890
Why didn't I realize?!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:40.390
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry! I–

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.140
I'm not asking you!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.480
I'm asking myself.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.400
Master Hayate wasn't sick.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.700
It was the curse of the Book of Darkness.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.450
The Book of Darkness, which had been
with Master Hayate since she was born...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.240
had shared an intricate
relationship with her.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:08.210
Its oppressive powers had eaten her body,
but since her Linker Core was yet immature,

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.420
not only did it impair her
normal bodily functions,

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.970
but it threatened her life as a whole.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:20.220
And as we welcomed our new master
with the Book's first awakening...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.600
the Book's appetite only grew.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:30.520
I should have known that the little
mana the four of us required

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:36.950
would have come from our master's
magic power, affecting her in turn.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.700
We have to save her...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.960
We have to save Hayate!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.960
Shamal! Shamal, your specialty
is with healing, right?!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.460
Can't you at least heal that kind of thing?!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.880
I'm sorry... I can't do anything
with my power alone...

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.090
Why...?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.850
Why?!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.180
Signum.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.770
There's not much we can do.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.110
However...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:21.700
<i>The curse of the Book of Darkness
is eating into our master's body.</i>

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:27.460
<i>If Hayate-chan is able to welcome
the true awakening of the Book...</i>

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.420
<i>...our master's disease will vanish!</i>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.210
<i>At the very least,
it will stop progressing!</i>

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.840
<i>Because I don't want to taint Hayate's
future with blood, I won't kill anyone!</i>

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:41.930
<i>But I'll do anything else!</i>

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:50.770
<i>I'm truly sorry, my master.
Just this once, I will break my promise.</i>

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.880
Please forgive our dishonor!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:26.850
<i>Everyone, come on down.
Dinner's ready!</i>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.020
Damn it...

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:41.990
The knight's clothes Hayate
gave me are all ruined...

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:49.500
Well... at least the clothes can be fixed,
and I did gather a good number of pages...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.460
It... doesn't... hurt!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.010
It doesn't hurt!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.300
This doesn't hurt one bit!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:08.010
I'm not the same as I was back then!

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:18.110
Once I get home, I'm sure a warm bath
and Hayate's food will be waiting for me.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:23.860
The kind Hayate will be
smiling widely and laughing!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:29.120
That's right.
I'm really happy right now!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.370
Which is why...

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.460
something like this doesn't hurt one bit!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.810
All three of us came here together...
I wonder if things will be fine back there?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:01.400
Well, I asked Alex to do
the monitoring for me, so...

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.990
It's all right if we just do some research
on the Book of Darkness, right?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:04.910
Yeah.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.570
The two we're about to meet
have a knack for the subject.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.790
Lieses, it's been a while.
It's me, Chrono.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.330
Wow!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.090
Chrosuke!
Long time no see!

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.090
Lotte!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.260
Let go!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:27.010
What's this? You're acting pretty cold to
the teacher you haven't seen in forever!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.600
Aria, can you do something about this, please?!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:34.060
It's been so long.
Why don't you just let her have fun?

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:37.690
And besides, it doesn't look
like you're too annoyed by it.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.860
You couldn't be more wro–

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.280
Liese Aria, it's been a while.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.990
Yeah! It's been a while.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.240
I see Liese Lotte is the same as ever.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:53.750
Even if she is my twin, I just
don't understand her sometimes.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.910
That was delicious.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.000
Liese Lotte... long time no see.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:02.880
Amy, it's been so long.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:06.680
It looks like you brought a
tasty-looking mouse boy here with you.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.430
What's your name?

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:16.430
How did someone like that
end up being my teacher?

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:21.270
Ah... I see. You're investigating
the Book of Darkness.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.400
We sorta heard what's
going on from our father.

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.110
We'll help as much as we can.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:27.650
Please do.

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:29.950
Amy-san...

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:31.570
Who are these people?

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:36.160
Chrono-kun's magic and
close combat teachers.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.420
Liese Aria was in charge of magic...

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:43.170
and Liese Lotte was in
charge of close combat.

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:46.050
They're Admiral Graham's twin familiars.

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.470
As you can see, they were made from cats.

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:53.050
I... I see...

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:57.640
It'd be reassuring to have you two
come to the base with me...

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.190
but you're busy with
work right now, huh?

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:00.190
Yeah...

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.480
It's just that we have this training program
to finish with the new Bureau members...

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:07.490
And we can't just leave
them hanging, so sorry.

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:12.160
It's all right. Actually, what I
mainly came to talk about... is him.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.240
Can I eat him?!

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:18.250
Sure. Do whatever you
want to him after work.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.580
Hey! Wait just one second!

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.500
So, what is it you came
to talk to us about?

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:31.510
I want you to assist him in searching
for something in the Infinity Library.

00:25:10.730 --> 00:25:14.450
Yuuno-kun's search further reveals
the true form of the Book of Darkness!

00:25:14.950 --> 00:25:17.700
How the decisive battle between
me and Signum turns out...

00:25:17.700 --> 00:25:21.240
And that masked guy comes back again, too!

00:25:22.080 --> 00:25:24.620
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:25.080 --> 00:25:26.120
Episode 7:

00:25:26.120 --> 00:25:28.710
With a Broken Past and Present.

00:25:29.710 --> 00:25:32.010
Drive Ignition!
